        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SWFJFOU9SMEo1U0cxbllqTjFiMDQ0YW1kbVFWRRAB!2m1!1s0x34040053f3097f43:0xf14c8a458348a153"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJQ38J81MABDQRU6FIg0WKTPE/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCVlMybERRa0o0UlRBeVZHaGxVa0ZuYVRsWllWRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "星期一的西貢，有種慢下來的幸福。\n少了假日的人潮，可以隨心走進一間 café，好好吃頓 lunch、喝杯咖啡。第一次來到 Sleepless，比想像中更有驚喜。\n\n店內氣氛舒服又療癒，木系設計加上小動物元素，很適合靜靜放空一下。\nSignature 的純朱古力非常濃厚，口感絲滑有層次，不會死甜，能喝得出用料認真。\n\n我點了 Mocha，朱古力和咖啡的比例拿捏得很好，咖啡本身帶點 fruity notes，配合起來很順口。\nAll Day Breakfast 食材新鮮，擺盤也很精緻，如果份量可以再多一點就更完美了☺️\n\n會想再回來的一間小店。\n\n⸻\n\nSai Kung on a Monday is such a joy — slow-paced, peaceful, and far less crowded.\nWe randomly walked into Sleepless for lunch, and it turned out to be a lovely surprise.\n\nThe café has a cozy and calming atmosphere, with warm wooden interiors and cute animal touches that make it a perfect place to slow down and unwind.\n\nTheir signature chocolate drink was rich and velvety without being overly sweet, with a really satisfying depth of flavour.\n\nI ordered the mocha, and the balance between chocolate and coffee was done beautifully. The coffee itself had slightly fruity notes, which made the drink even more enjoyable.\n\nThe all-day breakfast was fresh and nicely presented as well — though a slightly bigger portion would make it even better ☺️\n\nDefinitely a café I’d love to revisit.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "星期一的西貢，有種慢下來的幸福。\n少了假日的人潮，可以隨心走進一間 café，好好吃頓 lunch、喝杯咖啡。第一次來到 Sleepless，比想像中更有驚喜。\n\n店內氣氛舒服又療癒，木系設計加上小動物元素，很適合靜靜放空一下。\nSignature 的純朱古力非常濃厚，口感絲滑有層次，不會死甜，能喝得出用料認真。\n\n我點了 Mocha，朱古力和咖啡的比例拿捏得很好，咖啡本身帶點 fruity notes，配合起來很順口。\nAll Day Breakfast 食材新鮮，擺盤也很精緻，如果份量可以再多一點就更完美了☺️\n\n會想再回來的一間小店。\n\n⸻\n\nSai Kung on a Monday is such a joy — slow-paced, peaceful, and far less crowded.\nWe randomly walked into Sleepless for lunch, and it turned out to be a lovely surprise.\n\nThe café has a cozy and calming atmosphere, with warm wooden interiors and cute animal touches that make it a perfect place to slow down and unwind.\n\nTheir signature chocolate drink was rich and velvety without being overly sweet, with a really satisfying depth of flavour.\n\nI ordered the mocha, and the balance between chocolate and coffee was done beautifully. The coffee itself had slightly fruity notes, which made the drink even more enjoyable.\n\nThe all-day breakfast was fresh and nicely presented as well — though a slightly bigger portion would make it even better ☺️\n\nDefinitely a café I’d love to revisit.",
